{
  "about": "A set of place IDs kept on the device (createIdSetStore in src/lib/id-set-store.ts: visited and saved places). Each case starts from empty storage and runs its steps in order; each step is the operation (`do`), then `held`, the IDs the app holds after it, and `stored` the stored text (null when nothing is stored). `failWrites` makes storage writes fail (storage full) until turned off; `external` is another tab saving `raw` (with its storage event); `reload` starts the store again from storage. A change builds on the latest stored set plus this tab's unsaved changes; another tab's save drops the unsaved changes.",
